  "title": "Quenching Citrusy Indian Yogurt Lassi",
  "description": "A refreshing and tangy Indian drink featuring citrus flavors and cultured creme fraiche, perfect for hot summer days",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
